REMEDY CANDIDATES, UNGRADED AND NOT CHASED

Two shapes, recorded so the next reader does not re-derive them, and NEITHER is
recommended because the choice is a design question about what the fallback is
FOR:

  A. GUARD THE FALLBACK. Take the tag-as-data path only when the tag really is
     the token, and refuse loud otherwise. Cheap, honest, and it moves the
     odometer DOWN from 19 to 17 -- which is the correct direction and should be
     expected rather than treated as a regression. Note the ratchet would fire
     on it, which is the ratchet working: a re-pin with a sentence behind it.

  B. READ THE TRUE TOKEN WHERE THE GRAMMAR NAMES IT. `define DEFINing-^ ...`
     does say what DEFINing stands for; a fallback that could reach the using
     site would emit the right literal instead of refusing. Strictly better if
     it is reachable, strictly more work, and it may not be reachable at all for
     a hook like tokenize, which stands for no token in any position.

⚠ THEY ARE NOT ALTERNATIVES SO MUCH AS A ORDER: A is the safe floor and can land
without B. B without A would leave the hook case still wrong.

